Fix: the contextual Edit toolbar tab is painted with the primary colour
unconditionally, so it looks pressed even when inline edit mode is off and
the user has never clicked it. The first selector of the Inline Edit toggle
block carries no state; the .is-active selector that follows it is the one
that reflects edit mode. The equivalent block in
styles/layout/classic_toolbar.scss is correctly nested inside
#toolbar-bar.toolbar-bar.js-settings-tray-edit-mode.

Two further changes are needed for the resting state to actually look right.

The unqualified selector was masking the resting icon colour: the "Overrides
for default toolbar items" block gives the edit icon var(--gin-icon-color),
which is dark and disappears against the dark toolbar bar. The resting state
therefore gets the same rgba(255, 255, 255, .75) every other toolbar icon
uses, while the mask sizing from that overrides block is left untouched.

:focus becomes :focus-visible. A mouse click leaves the button focused, so
with plain :focus the tab stayed fully highlighted after the user toggled
edit mode back off, and only cleared once they clicked elsewhere. Clicking
does not match :focus-visible, keyboard focus does, so the affordance is
kept for keyboard users without the pressed look sticking after a click.

The compiled dist/ counterpart is patched alongside the source, since the
release ships pre-built CSS.

--- a/styles/components/toolbar.scss
+++ b/styles/components/toolbar.scss
@@ -87,9 +87,14 @@
     }
 
     // Inline Edit toggle
-    .toolbar-tab > .toolbar-icon.toolbar-icon-edit.toolbar-item,
+    .toolbar-tab > .toolbar-icon.toolbar-icon-edit.toolbar-item {
+      &::before {
+        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .75);
+      }
+    }
+
     .toolbar-tab > .toolbar-icon.toolbar-icon-edit.toolbar-item.is-active,
-    .toolbar-tab > .toolbar-icon.toolbar-icon-edit.toolbar-item:focus {
+    .toolbar-tab > .toolbar-icon.toolbar-icon-edit.toolbar-item:focus-visible {
       color: var(--gin-bg-app);
       background: var(--gin-color-primary);
 
--- a/dist/css/components/toolbar.css
+++ b/dist/css/components/toolbar.css
@@ -94,16 +94,18 @@
   transform: rotate(90deg);
 }
 
-.toolbar .toolbar-bar .toolbar-tab > .toolbar-icon.toolbar-icon-edit.toolbar-item, .toolbar .toolbar-bar .toolbar-tab > .toolbar-icon-edit.toolbar-item.responsive-preview-icon,
 .toolbar .toolbar-bar .toolbar-tab > .toolbar-icon.toolbar-icon-edit.toolbar-item.is-active,
-.toolbar .toolbar-bar .toolbar-tab > .toolbar-icon.toolbar-icon-edit.toolbar-item:focus {
